Rule: one folder = one module = one public prefix. Shared generic modules live in ruskmods/<name>/<name>.rk; system/IO modules live in rusklib/<name>/<name>.rk; installer frameworks keep their own folder with internal modules.

One generic library set in ruskmods/
Module	Name	Merges
ruskmods/semver.rk	semver	installwork/version.rk, installwork/requirement.rk, filter semver.rk, spec parsing
ruskmods/json.rk	json	existing ruskmods/json, filter json.rk
ruskmods/text.rk	text	installwork/text.rk, filter text.rk, wheat text helpers
ruskmods/path.rk	path	ruskmods/path, installwork path helpers, filter path text logic
ruskmods/manifest.rk	manifest	installwork/ruskfile.rk + filter manifest.rk (Ruskfile and package.json)
ruskmods/lock.rk	lock	installwork/state.rk + filter lockfile.rk (installed state + resolution lock)
ruskmods/archive.rk	archive	installwork/archive.rk + filter tar extraction (RUSKPKG + tar)
ruskmods/fs.rk	fs	installwork/fs.rk + filter fs helpers + pure parts of rusklib/files.rk
ruskmods/bytes.rk	bytes	new byte buffer/scanning helpers
ruskmods/maps.rk	maps	new ordered map/set helpers
ruskmods/result.rk	result	new ok/error/unwrap helpers
ruskmods/sha.rk	sha	SHA-1/256/512
ruskmods/gzip.rk	gzip	inflate/deflate
One system/IO library set in rusklib/
Module	Name	Merges
rusklib/http.rk	http	fetch, retries, ETag, TLS
rusklib/cache.rk	cache	metadata/tarball cache, atomic writes
rusklib/fs_fast.rk	fs_fast	hardlink/copy tree, atomic rename, temp files
rusklib/platform.rk	platform	OS/arch/libc/env/home/tmp detection
rusklib/term.rk	term	filter progress.rk + colors.rk
rusklib/bench.rk	bench	timers and phase reports
rusklib/rusklib.rk	rusklib	one-import bundle
Installer frameworks
Framework	Name	Purpose
ruskmods/installwork/	installwork	existing Rusk package installer
ruskmods/npmwork/	npmwork	npm/JS/TS installer: registry, resolver, installer, global, project, cli
